# StreetForge environment configuration

Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. Never commit `.env.local`.

## World Labs (World Generation)

- `WLT_API_KEY` — World Labs API key (server-side only, never exposed to the browser). Get one at https://platform.worldlabs.ai
- `WORLDLABS_API_BASE_URL` — optional override, defaults to `https://api.worldlabs.ai/marble/v1`
- `WORLDLABS_DRAFT_MODEL` — optional model override for DRAFT generation, defaults to `marble-1.0-draft`
- `WORLDLABS_FINAL_MODEL` — optional model override for FINAL generation, defaults to `marble-1.1`
- `WORLDLABS_LIVE_TESTS` — set to `true` only for tests which intentionally spend API credits
- `WORLDLABS_MOCK_MODE` — set to `true` to serve local fixture worlds instead of calling the World Labs API (no credits used)